      },
      {
        "id": "next-steps",
        "type": "step",
        "title": "Next",
        "anchor": "#right-panel",
        "position": "inside-top-left",
        "wWidth": 700,
        "description": "<p>The four loops do the same work with very different instructions: fewer instructions per element (SIMD) and more independent additions (several accumulators).</p><p>The next part of the lesson will simulate them and analyse when the <b>cache misses</b> limit their performance.</p>",
